{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "be99efa7c68676df6985aa222d33754d0f77d4dd3bbb8d24dc2cf67f4bcd567c", "ja": "飛び出そう、空に向かって！", "zh": "向着天空飞跃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "caa539d8f5d3c5a889a89d78c3b40620cc16fc758fc3d7bfcee6d765e8edebd3", "ja": "翼とひなたが屋上で自主練をしていると聞い\nて、様子を見にいくプロデューサー。ダンス\nが覚えられずに悩むひなたを励ましながら、\n翼は、ひなたや可奈のように、夢中になれる\nことがあるのは羨ましいと語るのだった。", "zh": "听说翼和日向在屋顶上自主练习，\n制作人决定过去看看状况。\n翼一边鼓励记不住舞蹈而烦恼的日向，\n一边诉说她其实很羡慕日向和可奈，\n能够拥有自己热衷的事物。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6eee304e46affce9d2be2ecc0f69a24ad6295cb92dbc4d8f653918dd92da88f6", "ja": "（今日は屋上で、翼とひなたが自主練をしてるらしい。\n少し覗いてみるか……）", "zh": "（听说今天翼和日向在屋顶上自主练习，\n去偷看一下好了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e8badedb0b2a6aaf30bced1be942e714683399d08e98f1a6eea2726bc76b07ff", "ja": "うん、このくらいかな。\nお疲れさま、ひなたちゃん。", "zh": "嗯，大概就是这样吧。\n辛苦你了，日向。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7df05c41638ccb2782d946710b4dbc41d0c44b90bce6270ac4cd4b0769dbd146", "ja": "（おっ、今ちょうど終わった所かな？）", "zh": "（哦，现在正好刚结束吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "62000b7f2bb1fccaa3ace7d430ea89c2aa64fdf0416d38d5516952982f8810fd", "ja": "ふぅ……いろいろ教えてくれてありがとうね、翼さん。\nとっても助かったよぉ。", "zh": "呼……谢谢你在各方面的指导，翼。\n真的帮了我很大的忙哪～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "674f1540001a00f09eed00a631dfee41d88921117ec60fb341dc5f5fec961ca9", "ja": "でも、ごめんねぇ。あたし、何回も同じところで、\nわからなくなってしまって……。", "zh": "可是很抱歉呢。\n我老是在同样的地方忘记接下来的动作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "23ce638b73ae1fae7b751d2447f59e1915679da999c9166131ce059ca4e4017c", "ja": "手の向きが逆だったところ？\n大丈夫だよ～、タイミングはあってるし！", "zh": "你是说手摆反了的那边？\n不要紧啦～至少时机有抓到啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "08ff41e964bb47a6ca79d9b4b99d31160bcfc29a8613332bca85e7e88573d877", "ja": "大丈夫……だといいんだけども……。", "zh": "不要紧吗……真是这样就好了哪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ff12e8e03f33433a848e91352466e96875d2571497f65f7aaf78a25536da8749", "ja": "翼、ひなた、ふたりともお疲れさま！\n頑張ってるみたいだな。", "zh": "翼、日向，两位都辛苦了！\n看来你们很努力在练习呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5515489342e6d05c5fcbda0fd6e697103929bd5490c357280939508998cd662e", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん♪\nお疲れさまでーす！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生♪\n辛苦你了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "bdb20d8fe89812965dc1eeb1d56877468d3b835f8ee95fabd3571b35428c74e1", "ja": "……お疲れさんです、{$P$}。", "zh": "……辛苦你了，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1010_p", "source_sha256": "58a6463333e0915f72959834cdf56e829418b6b260b881d9fa9ba910aa5bd038", "ja": "ひなた、どうやらダンスに不安があるみたいだけど……\nちょっと気にし過ぎじゃないか？", "zh": "日向好像还对跳舞的部分不放心……\n会不会有点在意过头了呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "6686d38aeb5a663c03b5acbda3d8657c1d537f3ecedbccfa03ce65c38c0535bb", "ja": "でも……。\nあたし、なかなか振り付けを覚えられてなくて……。", "zh": "可是……\n我一直都没办法好好记住舞步哪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "c6ff2bb109689aab3075ae9603eeba1e1d40b5a7e13057f3071e986ce1176ecf", "ja": "このままじゃ、みんなに迷惑をかけてしまいそう\nなんだわ。なんとかせねばと思ってるんだけども……。", "zh": "这样下去感觉会给大家添麻烦哪。\n我觉得该想办法解决才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1013_p", "source_sha256": "6aee0768e5ae94ba3e7bf54e831096c83b2ffb25a17206a892a42b6db819d2e4", "ja": "（……悪い結果ばかり考えて、\n頭も身体も縮こまってるのかな。ここは……）", "zh": "（……可能是一直往坏的方面想，\n结果思绪和身体都放不开了。这时候就该……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "18e57f09cc76fd0cff835eef6ce5e736543431f9d83bdb3eb268788bdc2663ed", "ja": "ねえねえ、ひなたちゃん。", "zh": "欸欸，日向。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "9c5f14e6c882315401dae1465c16a0029c685d27d4dae8787f1ef62e1804a2b7", "ja": "なんだろうか、翼さん。", "zh": "什么事哪，翼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4c0c0463dce92924a68d86e12ca12c6279410a83f84325376133ef06150d4bae", "ja": "もしかしてダンスの練習、あんまり楽しくない？", "zh": "你该不会其实觉得，练习跳舞不怎么开心？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "10505f4a314aa0d0685ec3a2126b3d244baf6cf6253e35b0e32151b0a5c63ad6", "ja": "あう……。", "zh": "啊呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1018_p", "source_sha256": "4a1c6f5b6606b6653bc5fb382af66d26308186137134a367be76d669d24e1864", "ja": "（翼……？）", "zh": "（翼……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "0b61e57d266e6ad8325726099c1fd3dfcfb1702241cee54b39972f08f351e428", "ja": "……翼さんは、お見通しなんだねぇ。\nダンスも上手だし、すごいんだねぇ。", "zh": "……真是瞒不过翼的法眼呢。\n舞蹈也跳得好，真厉害呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9bccf7d672fd2a896d59ec894202805132eff79240a47480c1589c3ed4783083", "ja": "え～、そうかなぁ？", "zh": "咦～会吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1021_035hin", "source_sha256": "92415f82ad84506ed1baf99b8cc25a853d944a68ceca2d216b6753b354b97c23", "ja": "あたしも翼さんやエレナさんみたいに、楽しんで\n踊らなくちゃって、思ってはいるんだけども……。", "zh": "我也想过自己应该要像翼和艾琳娜一样，\n怀着快乐的心情跳舞才行哪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1022_035hin", "source_sha256": "e6b877bcf9d2bb9cf3b08783b19907fa3bca0654c5fbbb134e12496a1b00a6b3", "ja": "また間違えるんじゃないか、ステージを台無しにして\nしまわないだろかって……考えてしまって……。", "zh": "但就是不禁会担心是否又跳错，\n是否会把表演搞砸……越想越深……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b2d525d9ff3136fb8985a69f5acb6c5d020cd803972683df380731620f227bb3", "ja": "そうなんだ。でも、そうなっちゃうよね～。\nダンスも、ちゃんとできるから面白いんだもん。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。不过，这很正常啊～\n跳舞也是跳得好了才会觉得有趣嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1024_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f5a904143b2bd290f957070b57a09ee58c5ea4789d32bd54310a30565a74b235", "ja": "あのね？　わたしも小っちゃい時、よくおにいちゃんに\nキャッチボールの相手をさせられたんだけど。", "zh": "跟你说喔，我小的时候，\n经常被哥哥找去当传接球的练习对象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6fdc5dccc622194e65281972d9c52875078918e1b7829ae72366f93fedca8bf7", "ja": "最初はボールをうまく投げられなくて。\nあの時は、ぜんぜん楽しくなかったな～。", "zh": "一开始我不太会投球，\n那时候觉得一点都不有趣～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1026_035hin", "source_sha256": "cee03b712ec6a3addf304a491233ead77effe86fa2e898dc391e205d5d667fe7", "ja": "ありゃあ。\n翼さんにも、できないことがあったのかい？", "zh": "哎呀，\n翼也有办不到的事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1027_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e24d13a5721553803bdbda60e2cf08da98144d027c9eed9a4bef028ff8607065", "ja": "いっぱいあるよ～。アイドルだって、\nまだ美希ちゃんみたいにできてないし～……。", "zh": "可多着呢～就连当偶像也是，\n还没办法做到像美希那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1028_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5b8945be45ffc8994e179dfae73030838b68fa903a8e2f751d49f8c6d3a60c59", "ja": "あ、でもキャッチボールはね、教えてもらったら\nできるようになって、ケッコー楽しかったよ！", "zh": "啊，不过我在讨教过后学会了传接球，\n就觉得其实挺有趣的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4dc72fa2f93f18bb47a2f070a1e87a97a9ea1436edf10ca777e7b9b1cc0b8d71", "ja": "だからひなたちゃんも、ちょっとずつ覚えてけばいい\nと思うな～。そしたら、だんだん楽しくなるかも♪", "zh": "所以日向也是，我觉得你只要慢慢学就可以了～\n这么一来，或许就能慢慢体会乐趣啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1030_035hin", "source_sha256": "1e541d5a32deb7a592a0dbdf360cafb6d9904cf412aa5e5659779220aaf76e1c", "ja": "……。ちょっとずつ覚えたら……\nちょっとずつ、楽しく……。", "zh": "……慢慢学……\n慢慢体会乐趣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1031_035hin", "source_sha256": "50bf077e78db9b90754cb3d418e72d9f5daea1d7b708d07a0d0083ba4292a647", "ja": "えへへ、そうだねぇ。ゆっくりでも、ちょっとずつ\n進めば、いつかはたどり着けるもんねぇ。", "zh": "嘿嘿，说得对呢～就算慢慢来，\n但只要一步步前进，最后总会抵达终点呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1032_035hin", "source_sha256": "7676bcc7c1be446826134537d140ea3456273ff05807c4f8bdfd1034930962aa", "ja": "ありがとう、翼さん。なんかあたしも、\nダンスが楽しくできそうな気がして来たよぉ！", "zh": "谢谢你，翼。\n我也开始觉得跳舞会很有趣了哪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1683631f704c38968efde5e7f57289d1a76b8804f69466bd925a6d8e87f9c52e", "ja": "え、ほんと？\nあはは、よかったね！", "zh": "咦，真的吗？\n哈哈，那太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1034_p", "source_sha256": "27a7f5c800bb5e95d4f986ac58a8977d3cf088218c607ca128fa72318a9b2978", "ja": "翼、俺からもありがとうな。今のひなたには、\n最高のアドバイスだったと思うぞ！", "zh": "翼，我也要向你道谢。\n我觉得这对现在的日向来说，是最好的建议了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1035_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6a22112ed1e4c656902550f69ea445859beb3c2c3cb155bb1508895bbfd5860a", "ja": "ホントですか～？\nそれじゃ、ごほうびくださ～い♪", "zh": "真的吗～？\n那么请给我奖励吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1036_p", "source_sha256": "a8dda056797adba9b5e758db5f07c120d4355fc56af48395d5cd3fe10695e056", "ja": "えっ。そ、そうか、それじゃ……せっかくだから、\n好きになったっていうキャッチボールでもするか！", "zh": "咦？这、这样啊，那么……难得提到了，\n就来玩你说喜欢上了的传接球吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1037_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6e090b858f5f17bc00124180dc40646d21723f8eb1fc10bc0120f2b952397d0a", "ja": "あ、キャッチボールならいいでーす。\nできるようになったら、すぐ飽きちゃった。", "zh": "啊，传接球的话就算了。\n学会之后很快就觉得腻了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1038_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bcd09d13143986496e5282606445a0607c706db2ca986fb38d0b5629d167a35e", "ja": "それに昨日も昴くんの相手をしたばっかりだし。\nわたし、アイスとかがいいな～♪", "zh": "而且昨天才陪昴玩过而已，\n我比较想要吃冰～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1039_p", "source_sha256": "5be3826c8c217010c65145a0680d81cf299499c800a605ba9c568f47ab074e8a", "ja": "そ、そうか……。さすがというか、\nそういう所も翼らしいというか……。", "zh": "这、这样啊……该说真不愧是翼吗？\n这种反应也很有你的风格呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1040_035hin", "source_sha256": "3e3869778ca2571b66f6ec9ef6a57e231cc77d90553fc29c8a2060c52e26fee3", "ja": "したっけ、翼さんは、\n今はなにが好きなんだい？", "zh": "这么说来，\n翼你现在喜欢什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1041_016tsu", "source_sha256": "38254c0ee85529eef324da90aec577ff0e3684b5a4eb48308d0cebfa9789b5c0", "ja": "わたしの好きなもの？\nん～……、探し中かな？", "zh": "我喜欢的东西？\n嗯……算是正在找吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1042_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ba409ec63debc8bd29cd9fe1a955670c3c7cae7cc65e05820a26929354714d63", "ja": "あ、お買い物とビーフステーキと、アイスと\n{$P$}さんは、大好きかも♪", "zh": "啊，购物、牛排、冰淇淋，还有\n{$P$}先生应该能列入最喜欢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1043_p", "source_sha256": "8c911349310128ebb37d682711b7f7f0e151dddb895b8477885f63d3185dcd45", "ja": "はは、ありがとう。\nちなみにひなたは、小さい頃から歌が好きなんだよな？", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢了。\n顺便一问，日向从小就喜欢唱歌对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1044_035hin", "source_sha256": "39e69f2647a81c4ccc19232cf5eebfc169b10567489582bd3a024d27807240cc", "ja": "うん、そうだよぉ♪　ばあちゃんに、いろんな歌を\n教わってね。いっつも農園で歌ってたんだわぁ。", "zh": "嗯，对呀♪奶奶教了我很多首歌喔，\n我们总是在农园里唱歌呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1045_p", "source_sha256": "088f81cb4d612ad84ea717cc9f906ff5e0c9b5ae8f85f613810f543750666473", "ja": "今でもひなたは、歌うとき楽しそうだよな。\n見てるこっちが幸せになるくらいに。", "zh": "日向现在唱歌也是一副开心的样子，\n连我看了都感觉很幸福。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1046_p", "source_sha256": "75dfc95323fc87eeae0c0de0f9fc62081aa7ac9eacbec4c63b353a34d9d9ca98", "ja": "……翼にもいつか見つかると思うよ。\nそんな風に、好きに……夢中になれるものが。", "zh": "……我想翼总有一天也会找到的。\n能让你像这样很喜欢……能够热衷的事物。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1047_016tsu", "source_sha256": "29bda4ab480673a91263b4422d99043d738bb0b6ad78b88b469481dcc76b32df", "ja": "夢中になれるものかぁ……。\nでも、なかなか見つからないんですよね～。", "zh": "热衷的事物啊……\n可是，实在是不太容易找到呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1048_035hin", "source_sha256": "99b6f1589bd529737dcdb46189150f7bdc4dd081dc5e97f361483a89107c65b9", "ja": "翼さんなら、きっとすぐ見つかるよぉ。", "zh": "我相信翼一定很快就会找到哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1049_016tsu", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1050_035hin", "source_sha256": "29e1b333d675c7dea668bd90934efb54e5e36a8a3ee5f0ce1b3c2be6bbbdaaff", "ja": "翼さんは、何でも上手にできるからねぇ。きっと、\n何でもすぐ楽しくなってしまうんでないかい？", "zh": "因为翼不论做什么都做得很好呢～\n一定做什么都能很快就享受到乐趣的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1051_035hin", "source_sha256": "27c5e555df11cd227f960961ce4703325ffa961e1ba1d2d9af460143de73fe08", "ja": "だからアイドルも、きっともうちょっとしたら、\nすぐ美希さんみたいになれるべさ！", "zh": "所以当偶像也是，一定只要再一段时间，\n你很快就能变得像美希一样了哪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1052_016tsu", "source_sha256": "23ddb0f2744aca9f89fb1e7764fc6e894304a8f9fc380b8f186208c6f7ebfdcd", "ja": "ひなたちゃん……。", "zh": "日向……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1053_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2a45959085e8ef4b51cd1c10cc04001bdb379f00aaa30278e4afc78d5aae72c4", "ja": "あはっ、ありがと！　だったらいいな～♪\nよーしっ、それじゃあ……。", "zh": "啊哈，谢啦！希望是如此～♪\n好，那么接下来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1054_016tsu", "source_sha256": "cde656d79bc507a6d42ab285b52a49b6834730dd0d50a346ee0b85ac8745b592", "ja": "次の公演も、やっぱり頑張っちゃお～っと。\nひなたちゃん、続きしよっか！", "zh": "下次公演还是好好努力吧～\n日向，我们继续练习！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1055_035hin", "source_sha256": "3e97c659f9cdd72a38842d64a7facc5d382e9341e82c5cc1f65a3af0e569885d", "ja": "うん！　よろしくねぇ、翼さん！", "zh": "嗯！请多指教呢～翼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1056_p", "source_sha256": "e2c94b2af19f5a1134b1028bd8f43da4e3019c88c25c87fc2627746539b449c8", "ja": "（翼とひなた。年も同じだし、\nいい関係になれてるみたいだな）", "zh": "（毕竟翼和日向年纪一样，\n看来建立了不错的关系啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_04_1057_p", "source_sha256": "78d5cd7524bfcde135cc4f3296a53ffd144b54011db74aa641adb2110fde07c2", "ja": "（支え合い、補い合いながら高みに上って……。\nこの調子でいつか、空いっぱいに輝いてくれよ！）", "zh": "（互相支持，彼此补足，携手攀上高峰……\n希望你们能维持下去，成为未来漫天绽放的光芒！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
